Flint Pay command-line interface

Usage:
  flint <command> [flags]
  flint help <command>          Help for a command or group
  flint help --all              Every command, one per line
  flint help search <words>     Find commands and topics offline

Flint-hosted account operations require Flint's hosted account sign-in and are excluded from discovery.

Start here:
  flint login
  flint signup
  flint init
  flint payment-links create
  flint help test-cards

Developer tools:
  api                              Call a Flint public API route
  api-request-logs                 get, list
  auth                             Sign in and out, import keys, export tokens, and show the active credential
  completion                       Print an offline bash, zsh, or fish completion script
  config                           Read, set, unset, and validate CLI configuration
  context                          List and switch authorized contexts
  demo-sessions                    Demo and test-drive sessions.
  doctor                           Check credential, connectivity, scopes, and API compatibility; explain scopes that need a live key
  help                             Command help, reference topics, and offline search
  history                          List or clear recent Flint resource IDs
  init                             Initialize Flint CLI context
  listen                           Forward Flint webhook events to a local endpoint using the local HMAC listen secret, regardless of endpoint signing methods. JWT handlers need an HMAC path or a local test bypass
  mcp                              Serve Flint operations to AI agents over MCP
  openapi                          API metadata.
  partner-app-installs             Partner apps installed on your account.
  partner-apps                     Partner app registration and install management.
  resource-timelines               get
  schema                           Command, input, output, error, and event schemas as JSON
  signup                           Create an account and sandbox key. Without a code, email a verification code and save progress; finish with --verification-code. MCP and --no-input use two calls.
  support                          Start a Flint Help thread with your context prefilled
  test-clocks                      Sandbox clocks that move customers and their subscriptions through time.
  trigger                          Create sandbox resources that produce a webhook event; no automatic cleanup (reset the sandbox when done)
  upgrade                          Upgrade Flint CLI to the latest stable release
  version                          Print CLI and public API schema version metadata
  Shortcuts: login, logout, reauth (auth login, logout, reauth), whoami (auth status)

